          "worked": "Case 1:\n$$\\begin{align*}5-x&=3\\\\-x&=-2\\\\x&=2.\\end{align*}$$\nCase 2:\n$$\\begin{align*}-(5-x)&=3\\\\5-x&=-3\\\\-x&=-8\\\\x&=8.\\end{align*}$$",
