          "short": "$x=7$ or $x=-4$",
          "worked": "Case 1:\n$$\\begin{align*}3-2x&=11\\\\-2x&=8\\\\x&=-4.\\end{align*}$$\nCase 2:\n$$\\begin{align*}-(3-2x)&=11\\\\3-2x&=-11\\\\-2x&=-14\\\\x&=7.\\end{align*}$$",
