        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=3$ or $x=-7$",
          "worked": "Case 1:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x+2}{5}&=1\\\\x+2&=5\\\\x&=3.\\end{align*}$$\nCase 2:\n$$\\begin{align*}-\\left(\\frac{x+2}{5}\\right)&=1\\\\\\frac{x+2}{5}&=-1\\\\x+2&=-5\\\\x&=-7.\\end{align*}$$",
